{"t":"2026-05-20T19:58:59.051Z","event":"sdk_msg","msg":{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WWq4axg1tiK6JEfEKhYi3G","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→# HYPHA-FRONTEND\n     2→\n     3→> HYPHA tag: `TA/FRONTEND`\n     4→> Maps to Mycelium agent: `frontend-agent`\n     5→\n     6→## Goal\n     7→\n     8→Own the React 19 + Vite 8 + Tailwind 4 frontend: UI primitives, page components, routing, auth context, API client, and the full user-facing dashboard experience. This is the human gate for the entire Talent Agent system.\n     9→\n    10→## Scope\n    11→\n    12→### In Scope\n    13→\n    14→- React 19 SPA with `react-router-dom` 7 routing\n    15→- Pages: `Landing`, `Login`, `VerifyAuth`, `Onboarding`, `Overview`, `Candidates`, `Pipeline`, `ReviewQueue`, `Analytics`, `Settings`\n    16→- Layout: `DashboardLayout` (sidebar + topbar shell)\n    17→- UI Primitives: `Button`, `Input`, `Card`, `Avatar`, `Badge`, `Dialog`, `Spinner`\n    18→- Components: `Sidebar`, `TopBar`, `StatCard`, `StatusBadge`\n    19→- Context: `AuthContext` for JWT + current user state\n    20→- API client: `lib/api.js` (Bearer token injection, base URL config via `VITE_API_BASE`)\n    21→- Tailwind 4 with design tokens from `DESIGN-CORE`\n    22→- Magic-link redirect handling on `/auth/verify?token=…`\n    23→- Vite dev server config (port 5173), production build\n    24→- Onboarding wizard: resume upload → profile form → land on Overview\n    25→- Review queue: detail panel with all artifact panes + Approve/Reject buttons\n    26→- Containerized via `frontend/Dockerfile` (nginx serving `dist/`)\n    27→\n    28→### Out of Scope\n    29→\n    30→- Real-time pub/sub streaming (polling at 5s; SSE/WebSocket is follow-up)\n    31→- Mobile responsive beyond table breakpoints (desktop-first)\n    32→- A11y audit pass (best-effort, not a freeze criterion)\n    33→- Internationalization / i18n\n    34→- Multi-theme switching (dark theme only)\n    35→- Multi-candidate / agency views (single-candidate MVP)\n    36→- Frontend tests (Playwright e2e is follow-up)\n    37→\n    38→## Inputs\n    39→\n    40→- `TA/DESIGN` (HYPHA-DESIGN-CORE): Design tokens, typography, color palette\n    41→- `TA/API` (HYPHA-API-SURFACE): All `/api/v1/*` endpoints\n    42→- `TA/AUTH` (HYPHA-AUTH): JWT shape, magic-link verify flow\n    43→- `TA/SCHEMA` (HYPHA-SCHEMA-CORE): Pydantic schemas (consumed via API responses)\n    44→- `NUTRIENTS.md`: Component prop contracts (§B), style system rules (§F)\n    45→\n    46→## Outputs (Deliverables)\n    47→\n    48→### Config & Build\n    49→\n    50→- `frontend/index.html`\n    51→- `frontend/package.json`\n    52→- `frontend/package-lock.json`\n    53→- `frontend/vite.config.js`\n    54→- `frontend/eslint.config.js`\n    55→- `frontend/start-dev.sh`\n    56→- `frontend/Dockerfile`\n    57→- `frontend/nginx.conf`\n    58→- `frontend/.gitignore`\n    59→\n    60→### Source\n    61→\n    62→- `frontend/src/main.jsx` — app entry\n    63→- `frontend/src/App.jsx` — router setup\n    64→- `frontend/src/index.css` — Tailwind entry + design tokens\n    65→\n    66→### Context & Lib\n    67→\n    68→- `frontend/src/context/AuthContext.jsx`\n    69→- `frontend/src/lib/api.js`\n    70→- `frontend/src/lib/routes.js`\n    71→\n    72→### Layouts\n    73→\n    74→- `frontend/src/layouts/DashboardLayout.jsx`\n    75→\n    76→### UI Primitives (components/ui/)\n    77→\n    78→- `frontend/src/components/ui/button.jsx`\n    79→- `frontend/src/components/ui/input.jsx`\n    80→- `frontend/src/components/ui/card.jsx`\n    81→- `frontend/src/components/ui/avatar.jsx`\n    82→- `frontend/src/components/ui/badge.jsx`\n    83→- `frontend/src/components/ui/dialog.jsx`\n    84→- `frontend/src/components/ui/spinner.jsx`\n    85→- `frontend/src/components/ui/types.js`\n    86→\n    87→### Domain Components\n    88→\n    89→- `frontend/src/components/Sidebar.jsx`\n    90→- `frontend/src/components/TopBar.jsx`\n    91→- `frontend/src/components/StatCard.jsx`\n    92→- `frontend/src/components/StatusBadge.jsx`\n    93→\n    94→### Pages\n    95→\n    96→- `frontend/src/pages/Landing.jsx`\n    97→- `frontend/src/pages/Login.jsx`\n    98→- `frontend/src/pages/VerifyAuth.jsx`\n    99→- `frontend/src/pages/Onboarding.jsx`\n   100→- `frontend/src/pages/Overview.jsx`\n   101→- `frontend/src/pages/Candidates.jsx`\n   102→- `frontend/src/pages/Pipeline.jsx`\n   103→- `frontend/src/pages/ReviewQueue.jsx`\n   104→- `frontend/src/pages/Analytics.jsx`\n   105→- `frontend/src/pages/Settings.jsx`\n   106→\n   107→### Design Documentation\n   108→\n   109→- `frontend/src/design/CHEATSHEET.md`\n   110→- `frontend/src/design/tokens.reference.md`\n   111→\n   112→### Static Assets\n   113→\n   114→- `frontend/public/` (favicon, etc.)\n   115→\n   116→## Acceptance Criteria\n   117→\n   118→- [ ] `npm install && npm run dev` starts Vite on port 5173 without errors\n   119→- [ ] `npm run build` produces a clean `dist/` with no JSX/TS errors\n   120→- [ ] `npm run lint` passes\n   121→- [ ] `/` → `Landing` for unauthenticated; authenticated redirect to `/overview`\n   122→- [ ] `/login` calls `POST /auth/request-link`, displays dev-mode magic link when `DEBUG=true`\n   123→- [ ] `/auth/verify?token=…` stores JWT in `AuthContext`, redirects appropriately\n   124→- [ ] `/onboarding` is 2-step wizard: PDF upload → profile form → redirect to `/overview`\n   125→- [ ] All dashboard routes gated by `AuthContext` — unauthenticated → `/login`\n   126→- [ ] `/review-queue` shows pipelines at `AWAITING_REVIEW` with all four artifact panels\n   127→- [ ] Approve/Reject buttons call `/review/{id}/approve` and `/review/{id}/reject`\n   128→- [ ] `Sidebar` highlights active route; navigation works without full reloads\n   129→- [ ] All requests use `lib/api.js` with auto-injected `Authorization: Bearer <jwt>`\n   130→- [ ] No hex literals in JSX — all colors via CSS custom properties or Tailwind tokens\n   131→- [ ] `StatusBadge` renders distinct visuals for every status enum value\n   132→- [ ] `frontend/Dockerfile` produces nginx image serving `dist/` at port 80 with SPA rewrite\n   133→- [ ] Lucide-react is the only icon library — no heroicons, no react-icons\n   134→\n   135→## Notes\n   136→\n   137→- React 19's `use()` hook is available but not required; existing `useEffect` patterns are fine.\n   138→- The dev API base URL is `http://localhost:8000/api/v1`; set via `VITE_API_BASE` for staging/prod.\n   139→- `lib/api.js` is the ONLY legal place to construct fetch URLs. Pages call `api.get/post(…)`, never raw `fetch`.\n   140→- Review Queue is the highest-leverage surface in MVP — production-grade polish required.\n   141→- Analytics page is a shell — real metrics are out of scope; route must exist and not crash.\n   142→- This biome consumes `DESIGN-CORE` tokens; it does NOT extend or redefine them.\n   143→\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4a9e8a7b-c074-497d-a64e-220d47ef23aa","uuid":"490930e2-0f40-49fb-b989-efa332fee607","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/spy/mfautomation/repos/creation-station/reverse-search/hyphae/HYPHA-FRONTEND.md","content":"# HYPHA-FRONTEND\n\n> HYPHA tag: `TA/FRONTEND`\n> Maps to Mycelium agent: `frontend-agent`\n\n## Goal\n\nOwn the React 19 + Vite 8 + Tailwind 4 frontend: UI primitives, page components, routing, auth context, API client, and the full user-facing dashboard experience. This is the human gate for the entire Talent Agent system.\n\n## Scope\n\n### In Scope\n\n- React 19 SPA with `react-router-dom` 7 routing\n- Pages: `Landing`, `Login`, `VerifyAuth`, `Onboarding`, `Overview`, `Candidates`, `Pipeline`, `ReviewQueue`, `Analytics`, `Settings`\n- Layout: `DashboardLayout` (sidebar + topbar shell)\n- UI Primitives: `Button`, `Input`, `Card`, `Avatar`, `Badge`, `Dialog`, `Spinner`\n- Components: `Sidebar`, `TopBar`, `StatCard`, `StatusBadge`\n- Context: `AuthContext` for JWT + current user state\n- API client: `lib/api.js` (Bearer token injection, base URL config via `VITE_API_BASE`)\n- Tailwind 4 with design tokens from `DESIGN-CORE`\n- Magic-link redirect handling on `/auth/verify?token=…`\n- Vite dev server config (port 5173), production build\n- Onboarding wizard: resume upload → profile form → land on Overview\n- Review queue: detail panel with all artifact panes + Approve/Reject buttons\n- Containerized via `frontend/Dockerfile` (nginx serving `dist/`)\n\n### Out of Scope\n\n- Real-time pub/sub streaming (polling at 5s; SSE/WebSocket is follow-up)\n- Mobile responsive beyond table breakpoints (desktop-first)\n- A11y audit pass (best-effort, not a freeze criterion)\n- Internationalization / i18n\n- Multi-theme switching (dark theme only)\n- Multi-candidate / agency views (single-candidate MVP)\n- Frontend tests (Playwright e2e is follow-up)\n\n## Inputs\n\n- `TA/DESIGN` (HYPHA-DESIGN-CORE): Design tokens, typography, color palette\n- `TA/API` (HYPHA-API-SURFACE): All `/api/v1/*` endpoints\n- `TA/AUTH` (HYPHA-AUTH): JWT shape, magic-link verify flow\n- `TA/SCHEMA` (HYPHA-SCHEMA-CORE): Pydantic schemas (consumed via API responses)\n- `NUTRIENTS.md`: Component prop contracts (§B), style system rules (§F)\n\n## Outputs (Deliverables)\n\n### Config & Build\n\n- `frontend/index.html`\n- `frontend/package.json`\n- `frontend/package-lock.json`\n- `frontend/vite.config.js`\n- `frontend/eslint.config.js`\n- `frontend/start-dev.sh`\n- `frontend/Dockerfile`\n- `frontend/nginx.conf`\n- `frontend/.gitignore`\n\n### Source\n\n- `frontend/src/main.jsx` — app entry\n- `frontend/src/App.jsx` — router setup\n- `frontend/src/index.css` — Tailwind entry + design tokens\n\n### Context & Lib\n\n- `frontend/src/context/AuthContext.jsx`\n- `frontend/src/lib/api.js`\n- `frontend/src/lib/routes.js`\n\n### Layouts\n\n- `frontend/src/layouts/DashboardLayout.jsx`\n\n### UI Primitives (components/ui/)\n\n- `frontend/src/components/ui/button.jsx`\n- `frontend/src/components/ui/input.jsx`\n- `frontend/src/components/ui/card.jsx`\n- `frontend/src/components/ui/avatar.jsx`\n- `frontend/src/components/ui/badge.jsx`\n- `frontend/src/components/ui/dialog.jsx`\n- `frontend/src/components/ui/spinner.jsx`\n- `frontend/src/components/ui/types.js`\n\n### Domain Components\n\n- `frontend/src/components/Sidebar.jsx`\n- `frontend/src/components/TopBar.jsx`\n- `frontend/src/components/StatCard.jsx`\n- `frontend/src/components/StatusBadge.jsx`\n\n### Pages\n\n- `frontend/src/pages/Landing.jsx`\n- `frontend/src/pages/Login.jsx`\n- `frontend/src/pages/VerifyAuth.jsx`\n- `frontend/src/pages/Onboarding.jsx`\n- `frontend/src/pages/Overview.jsx`\n- `frontend/src/pages/Candidates.jsx`\n- `frontend/src/pages/Pipeline.jsx`\n- `frontend/src/pages/ReviewQueue.jsx`\n- `frontend/src/pages/Analytics.jsx`\n- `frontend/src/pages/Settings.jsx`\n\n### Design Documentation\n\n- `frontend/src/design/CHEATSHEET.md`\n- `frontend/src/design/tokens.reference.md`\n\n### Static Assets\n\n- `frontend/public/` (favicon, etc.)\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] `npm install && npm run dev` starts Vite on port 5173 without errors\n- [ ] `npm run build` produces a clean `dist/` with no JSX/TS errors\n- [ ] `npm run lint` passes\n- [ ] `/` → `Landing` for unauthenticated; authenticated redirect to `/overview`\n- [ ] `/login` calls `POST /auth/request-link`, displays dev-mode magic link when `DEBUG=true`\n- [ ] `/auth/verify?token=…` stores JWT in `AuthContext`, redirects appropriately\n- [ ] `/onboarding` is 2-step wizard: PDF upload → profile form → redirect to `/overview`\n- [ ] All dashboard routes gated by `AuthContext` — unauthenticated → `/login`\n- [ ] `/review-queue` shows pipelines at `AWAITING_REVIEW` with all four artifact panels\n- [ ] Approve/Reject buttons call `/review/{id}/approve` and `/review/{id}/reject`\n- [ ] `Sidebar` highlights active route; navigation works without full reloads\n- [ ] All requests use `lib/api.js` with auto-injected `Authorization: Bearer <jwt>`\n- [ ] No hex literals in JSX — all colors via CSS custom properties or Tailwind tokens\n- [ ] `StatusBadge` renders distinct visuals for every status enum value\n- [ ] `frontend/Dockerfile` produces nginx image serving `dist/` at port 80 with SPA rewrite\n- [ ] Lucide-react is the only icon library — no heroicons, no react-icons\n\n## Notes\n\n- React 19's `use()` hook is available but not required; existing `useEffect` patterns are fine.\n- The dev API base URL is `http://localhost:8000/api/v1`; set via `VITE_API_BASE` for staging/prod.\n- `lib/api.js` is the ONLY legal place to construct fetch URLs. Pages call `api.get/post(…)`, never raw `fetch`.\n- Review Queue is the highest-leverage surface in MVP — production-grade polish required.\n- Analytics page is a shell — real metrics are out of scope; route must exist and not crash.\n- This biome consumes `DESIGN-CORE` tokens; it does NOT extend or redefine them.\n","numLines":143,"startLine":1,"totalLines":143}}}}
